**PUSHT ORGANIC**

*"**Pure. Nourishing. Trustworthy.**"** | Est. 2024–25*

BRAND BIBLE v2.0 | Brahhm Arpan Organic Pvt. Ltd.

**1. BRAND FOUNDATION**

**Brand Name ****&**** Meaning**

Pusht (पुष्ट) is Sanskrit for nourished, well-fed, thriving, and strong. The name encapsulates the brand's core promise: organic food that truly nourishes — body, community, and environment.

**Mission Statement**

To provide the purity of nature through a certified organic food range that nurtures health, sustains the environment, and uplifts the farmer community — transparently, from farm to table.

**Core Values**

• Purity — Free from chemicals, pesticides, GMOs. Always certified

• Transparency — Full traceability from farm to packaging

• Farmer Partnership — Works directly with farmers, supports organic transition

• Fair Price — Organic accessible to all income groups

• Environmental Care — Soil health, biodiversity, reduced carbon

**Certifications**

• USDA Organic / Jaivik Bharat / FSSAI / India Organic / PGS-India Organic / FOODCERT (APEDA-accredited)

