**2. TARGET AUDIENCE**

• Conscious Homemaker — 28–50 yrs, manages family nutrition, reads labels

• Health-Conscious Parent — Wants safe, chemical-free food for children

• Fitness Enthusiast — Prioritises clean protein: organic dal, millets, seeds

• Chef / Food Professional — Values ingredient quality and flavour authenticity

**What They Care About**

• Moving away from chemically-grown produce from unknown sources

• Brands that claim "natural" without certification proof

• Overpriced organic that feels inaccessible to regular families

Free shipping above ₹350. Price range ₹46–₹640 — organic at every budget.

