**4. VISUAL IDENTITY**

**Brand Colours — Canonical Hex Codes**

• Forest Green: #1A5C1A — Primary brand colour

• Leaf Green: #2E8B2E — Secondary / accent

• Cream Ivory: #F5F0D0 — Background / fill

• Wheat Gold: #8B6914 — Warm accent

• White: #FFFFFF — Text on dark backgrounds

