| --- |

**Photography Style**

• Natural light — golden hour, soft daylight, never harsh studio flash

• Earthy textures: jute, clay, wood, stone, terracotta

• Ingredient-forward: raw millets, fresh produce, spice piles

• Farm and field imagery: green fields, farmer hands, rural harvest

• Kitchen lifestyle: clean Indian home kitchen, traditional utensils

**What to Never Show**

• Bold reds, blacks, dark dramatic aesthetics (Caveman territory)

• Processed or fast-food adjacent imagery

• Cold, clinical, white-lab aesthetics

