**6. CONTENT PILLARS**

• Farmer Stories — Real people, real farms, real numbers

• Ingredient Deep Dives — What makes organic dal different, millet varieties explained

• Recipe & Cooking — Traditional Indian recipes, seasonal focus, Hinglish voice

• Certification & Trust — Why certifications matter, what India Organic means

• Sustainability — Soil health, biopesticides, water conservation

• Daily Nutrition — How to include organic staples in everyday meals

• The Fair Price Promise — Organic is not a luxury. Proof with actual prices.

